  "note": [
    "How much potency each job lands per second, and how it is split between the global cooldown",
    "and everything else. This is the only part of the damage estimate that is modelled rather than",
    "read out of the game, and it exists because the alternative is a rotation simulator per job.",
    "",
    "It scales one job's number as a whole. It therefore moves the DPS figure a player is shown and",
    "does NOT move the ranking between two players of the same job competing for the same coffer,",
    "which is what the loot plan actually asks. A profile that is ten percent out is a cosmetic",
    "problem, not a distribution one.",
    "",
    "Set calibrated to true for a job once its number has been held against a gear planner for a",
    "known set. Until then the UI says the DPS figure is an estimate, which it is.",
    "",
    "attackPowerMultiplier is the level 100 value: 190 for tanks, 237 for everyone else."
  ],
